<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Standard Bank opens in Dubai.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Standard Bank opens in Dubai.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Standard Bank Group said on Monday that its Standard Bank London unit had become the first South African-owned bank to operate in Dubai with the opening of a representative office.</p>
<p>Dubai general manager Jeffrey Rhodes said the office would specialise in commodity finance and gold.</p>
<p>Dubai last year imported some 350 tonnes of gold, much of it from South Africa, the world's largest producer of the metal with annual production of nearly 500 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
